 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** Depends on the volume rendering cost plus the stroke generation and rasterization cost. Not given in the sources.
-- **Memory Complexity:** Requires storage for both scalar and vector fields, plus temporary storage for stroke data structures. Not given in the sources.
